VIUA-ASM(7) "Viua VM PUT_VIUAVM_VERSION_HERE" "Viua VM Manual"

# NAME

viua-asm - Viua VM assembly language reference

# SYNOPSIS

*.directive*++
*.directive:* _argument_

*instruction* [_argument_...]

# DESCRIPTION

Viua assembly language is used to compose the source code of programs to be
executed by the Viua virtual machine.
The language consists of *directives* and *instructions*;
the former directing the assembler, and the latter being encoded into the binary
form that, after further processing by *viua-ld*(1), the virtual machine can
understand.

# FILES

*.s*, *.asm*
	By convention, the files containing Viua assembly language source code have
	either *.s* or *.asm* suffix.

# SEE ALSO

*viua-asm*(1),
*viua-ld*(1).

